### Actuator health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Pre-register device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SN-TEST-001",
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "deviceType": "sensor",
  "location": "lab",
  "logicalGroup": "group1",
  "responsible": "me"
}

### First contact (will fail signature but checks route)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollment/first-contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SN-TEST-001",
  "did": "did:algo:TEST",
  "publicKey": "PUBLICKEYBASE32",
  "signature": "INVALID"
}
